OL,3,GNEWSAPeople urged to use nature to
OL,4,Aimprove fitness
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardening, walking and volunteering for
OL,7,Fconservation work are among the ways
OL,8,Fpeople in Surrey are being encouraged
OL,9,Fto improve their fitness under a new
OL,10,Fscheme.
OL,12,FSurrey County Council has launched its
OL,13,FGreen Health and Wellbeing scheme, with
OL,14,Fan investment of #170,000.
OL,16,FIt will help small organisations such
OL,17,Fas community gardens and walking groups
OL,18,Fgrow and work together.
OL,20,FThe programme is being run in
OL,21,Fpartnership with the Community
OL,22,FFoundation for Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
